  "basis": "The dashboard (chart_1) is titled 'Additional Top Stores: Ad Spend vs Sales' and plots only five stores (Store 6 through Store 10). The axes show Advertising Spend (x-axis, $ thousands) and Sales (y-axis, $ thousands). While the points show a positive correlation (e.g., Store 6 at ~$30k spend/$60k sales to Store 10 at ~$70k spend/$157k sales), the chart lacks data on the full store population, profitability, or ROI. The task instructions require reviewing the dashboard to decide routing. Given the limited scope of the data (subset of stores, no profit metrics), the evidence is insufficient to 'Approve broader ad-spend increase' or to 'Defer' without cause. The appropriate routing for a decision requiring more comprehensive data is to hold for further analysis.",
  "option_label": "Select 'Hold and request full-data analysis'"
}
